<h1>For Businesses</h1>
<p class="lede">Island and Mount Pleasant businesses have supported this school for generations — realtors, builders, architects, restaurants, and shops. Sponsorship puts your name in front of the whole SIES community, and it's fully tax-deductible.</p>

<section aria-labelledby="directory-signs">
  <h2 id="directory-signs">Directory &amp; fence sign sponsorship</h2>
  <p>Each September, local businesses sponsor placement in the school directory and on banner signage along the school fence — seen daily by hundreds of families across Sullivan's Island, Isle of Palms, and Mount Pleasant.</p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="auction-sponsor">
  <h2 id="auction-sponsor">Spring Auction sponsorship &amp; donations</h2>
  <p>Our spring silent auction is the biggest FRIENDS event of the year. Businesses take part by sponsoring the event or donating items and experiences — art, travel, dining, wellness, and more.</p>
</section>

